    {
      "source": "A boundary for a service-level objective (SLO) for use when configuring Micrometer. Can\nbe specified as either a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Double.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Double</code></a> (applicable to timers and distribution\nsummaries) or a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Duration</code></a> (applicable to only timers).",
      "translation": "用于配置 Micrometer 时服务级别目标（SLO）的边界。可以指定为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Double.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Double</code></a>`（适用于计时器和分布摘要）或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Duration</code></a>`（仅适用于计时器）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the underlying value of the SLO in form suitable to apply to the given meter\ntype.",
      "translation": "返回适用于给定计量器类型的 SLO 底层值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>value</code> - the source value",
      "translation": "<code>value</code> - 源值",
      "count": 2
